Notes

TBridge does not depend on any third-party UI, networking, or JSON runtime
library. The JSON encoder/decoder used by the bridge is hand-written in
Json.kt; no Gson or other JSON library is bundled. The module declares no
Android permissions and contains no network-upload or data-collection code.
